        "content": "<p>Currently, <code>#eval (0 : Real)</code> shows something like <code>(Real.ofCauchy (sorry /- 0, 0, 0, ... -/))</code>.<br>\nI understand that this is because <code>Real</code> is implemented as a quotient of Cauchy sequences, and it is impossible to peek at a function (closure) to know that it is a constant function, unless you happen to have a proof. (Already, in order to peek at the Cauchy sequence used in the quotient, the <code>Repr</code> instance need to be <code>unsafe</code>.)<br>\nNonetheless, for convenience/teaching purposes, it would be nice to show <code>0</code> at such an <code>#eval</code>.</p>\n<p>One way I can see to do this is to make another type isomorphic to <code>ℝ</code> which may contain a computable certificate (<code>sorry</code> substituted in places of some proofs for brevity):</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyPreReal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">//</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myPreRealSetoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Setoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyPreReal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">iseqv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyReal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Quotient</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myPreRealSetoid</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myRealIsomorphicToReal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">MyReal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The conversion from ℚ keeps the certificate around:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyReal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Quotient</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk''</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Implementation of <code>Repr</code> uses the rational certificate if available:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">unsafe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Repr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Quotient</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myPreRealSetoid</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- oddly `Repr MyReal` doesn't work</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">reprPrec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unquot</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reprPrec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reprPrec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Computations preserve the representative if possible:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyPreReal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">λ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">qa</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hqa</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">qb</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hqb</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">qa</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">qb</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Nonetheless, this is</p>\n<ul>\n<li>clunky, and</li>\n<li>theorems proved for <code>ℝ</code> doesn't work for <code>MyReal</code> out of the box.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>What is usually done in these cases?</p>",
